 <h3><u>Mashhad mein</u></h3> 
 <div style=width:100%> 
  <p></p>
  <p>Ye chaukhat choom kar ki hai dua har baar mashhad mein..(2)</p> 
  <p>Ilahi theher jae waqt ki raftaar mashhad mein</p> 
  <p>Ye chaukhat choom kar ki hai dua har baar mashhad mein..(2)</p> 
  <p>1. Janaze to bohot aate hue dekhe magar maine..(2)<br> nahi dekhe kahi bhi maut ke aasaar mashhad mein</p> 
  <p>2. Suna hai khud shifa dene ko aate hai waha maula..(2)<br> so ab khud jaa ke mai hojaunga beemaar mashhad mein</p> 
  <p>3. Raza ke husn par yusuf ko bikte dekhti duniya..(2)<br> agar hota kahi jo misr ka bazaar mashhad mein</p> 
  <p>4. Suna kar manqabat maula ki mai unse dua lunga..(2)<br> milenge jab kabhi bhi meesam e tammar mashhad mein</p> 
  <p>5. Wo chahe ghar ki surat ho ya chahe qabr ki surat..(2)<br> khuda wanda banade meer ka darbaar mashhad mein</p> 
